        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/51186c03ae44710671cf3ac3c053d5f1.avif?t=1775621341\" width=850 height=207 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>PLAY ONLINE ON STEAM USING THE REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER FEATURE</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the guiding light fades, a new path reveals itself. UniDuni is a tale of two tiny friends that have their lives turned upside down in a blink of an eye and suddenly have to challenge themselves and their beliefs. An introspective adventure of acceptance and change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/5f54a4f251be4f2fc11ba16b30c115d1.poster.avif?t=1775621341\" width=584 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/5f54a4f251be4f2fc11ba16b30c115d1.webm?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/5f54a4f251be4f2fc11ba16b30c115d1.mp4?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this odd perky world made by hand with a friend in a seamless local co-op experience just like old times or play online using Steam's Remote Play Together. Support (or mess with) each other by solving exotic trials or take the challenge to the limit making all the work yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>As you wish:</strong> Approach every challenge, collect all guaranas and perfectly avoid the hazards before the time runs out to unlock the astonishing gold medal, or play in a more casual and relaxed way enjoying every subtle detail. It's up to you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/ab427ec91b5697b4f5f4a66883b13ac4.poster.avif?t=1775621341\" width=584 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/ab427ec91b5697b4f5f4a66883b13ac4.webm?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/ab427ec91b5697b4f5f4a66883b13ac4.mp4?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unique environments:</strong> Dive into exciting landscapes with peculiar obstacles and designs that tell a story. Progress through forests with gigantic trees, dense slimy swamps, cold introspective mountains, frantic scorching volcanoes and gloomy complex dungeons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/8010c5a6aa0e85006348f05512f846f7.poster.avif?t=1775621341\" width=584 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/8010c5a6aa0e85006348f05512f846f7.webm?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/8010c5a6aa0e85006348f05512f846f7.mp4?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Funny problem solving:</strong> Play with mechanics that interact with each other. Push boxes, jump on springs, shoot the cannons, avoid the spikes, keep the cool on the balancing board, find secrets and much more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/2527cd2e4339babe936ca67e416df4c1.poster.avif?t=1775621341\" width=584 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/2527cd2e4339babe936ca67e416df4c1.webm?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/2527cd2e4339babe936ca67e416df4c1.mp4?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and cozy story:</strong> Discover a wholehearted story of emotions and actions. Help Uni and Duni to bring hope to the most unexpected places and foes. Engage with cute friends and weird enemies by trying to restore what was once stolen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/0392d2b710f61aad3be89b0dab7e6bd3.poster.avif?t=1775621341\" width=584 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/0392d2b710f61aad3be89b0dab7e6bd3.webm?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1305150/extras/0392d2b710f61aad3be89b0dab7e6bd3.mp4?t=1775621341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
